e</i> and carve your path in motorsports, overcoming challenges, winning championships, and leaving your mark as a true racing champion!</p>","developers":["Heat Games Ltda"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610810/94aab5d0308a373bb5516ee843bcdb97f59d781f/header.jpg?t=1772467550","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Steam OS 3.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1650<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3610810/155270627/b252b115470f1dbb66e66ec532ae2d69ab6845a4/1770832464/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770834225","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3610810/155270627/b252b115470f1dbb66e66ec532ae2d69ab6845a4/1770832464/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770834225","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3610810/155270627/b252b115470f1dbb66e66ec532ae2d69ab6845a4/1770832464/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770834225","id":257284783,"name":"All Racing Series in One Lap","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257284783/258408898d851018e75e27e55b54d3c6d4fd29ca/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770834225"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3610810/1667619888/77e122861937729a3911863290eb2cdf5005ccf8/1757087575/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757090775","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3610810/1667619888/77e122861937729a3911863290eb2cdf5005ccf8/1757087575/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757090775","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_